"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Whitfield JB, Zhu G, Landers JG, Martin NG (2020). Pessimism is associated with greater all-cause and cardiovascular mortality, but optimism is not protective. Scientific Reports, 10, 12609. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41598-020-69388-y","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1038/s41598-020-69388-y"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["争议。这只是观察，没有分组。有人会说「其实是先有病才悲观」，作者反驳说，真那样的话癌症死亡也该相关。但仍然可能有没测到的因素。乐观并没有保护作用，所以不必强迫自己「积极思考」。要做的是别把悲观预期当成对未来的准确预测。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/03-14"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"发现自己在反复回想同一件糟心事时，换个需要动手的活"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/03-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"减少让你消耗的人际关系，学会拒绝不想接的请求"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-11"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["下午困了就睡 10 分钟，不要睡半小时"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10 分钟的小睡当场就能提神，效果能撑两个半小时。睡 5 分钟基本没用。睡 20 分钟要等半小时以后才见效。睡 30 分钟，醒来先有一段发懵，那阵子表现比不睡还…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-12"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["在开放式办公室工作时用耳塞或找安静房间做需要记忆的活"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["背景噪音从 39 分贝涨到 51 分贝，能记住的词就变少，人更累，也更不想干活。休息的时候看带声音的自然风光片，比接着听办公室噪音更能把精力找回来。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-13"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["别把每周工作时间一味往上加：过了 49 小时上下，多干一小时多出的活越来越少"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["一战时英国军工厂的记录显示，每周干 49 小时以内，干多久就出多少活。超过 49 小时，多干一小时多出的活越来越少。一周干 70 小时和干 56 小时出的活几乎…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-17"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["生气时先离场，把对方当天气而不是当敌人"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["换个角度看刚发生的事，或者站到对方立场想一下，都能把情绪降下来，后一种更管用。只是不把情绪表现出来，也有一点效果；硬压住心里的感受、硬不去想那件事，都没用。惩罚…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-18"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["情绪低落时先做性价比最高的几件事：动起来、晒太阳、按时睡、找人说、打 12356"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["对抑郁来说，快走和慢跑效果最好，强度越大越有效，细节见第 22 节第 6 条（心情差就去走或者跑）。晒光照对季节性抑郁效果很强，对不分季节的抑郁也有效。网上的自…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-19"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["把警察、医生、柜员当成按规则上班的人，别当成角色：能推动事情的是文书和期限，不是情绪"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["警察、医生、柜员都是按岗位规则上班的人，被文书、期限和监督管着。对方态度好不好，和你的事办不办、几天办完基本无关。所以要拿回执、记期限、按渠道申诉，别想着把道理…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/03"},"children":["阅读整个主题：不要浪费精力 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["全书"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-star","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 